Assist the Director of Bands with making photo copies of parts and distributing them to the students enrolled in Wind Ensemble (Spring semester) and/ or Marching Band ... View Details Bookmark Hyflex Classroom Assistant 2026-2027 2027141TP Academic Affairs Temporary 01/15/2027 The HyFlex (Hybrid-Flexible) class delivery combines in-person and online learning, giving students the flexibility to choose how they will participate. In a HyFlex course, students can attend in-person, participate synchronously online via video conferencing tools, or engage asynchronously through recorded lectures and digital materials. This approach ensures that students can tailor their lea... View Details Bookmark Assistant Technical Director 2026087SP Dept of Humanities Staff 09/21/2026 About the Position:The Assistant Technical Director is responsible for departmentally produced shows, including theatrical productions for Masquers, Town and Gown, and Academy for the Arts; musical productions for the Fairmont State bands and choirs, and special events, as required. The position provides scenic construction and technical support. Assists students in the execution of related pro... View Details Bookmark Falcon Center - Lifeguard 2027090STP Auxiliary Events and Services Student 09/30/2026 - Responsible for the health, safety and welfare of patrons utilizing the Falcon Center Aquatic Facility- Patron surveillance of all those utilizing the aquatics area- Perform cleaning and preventative maintenance to the aquatics area as needed- Will serve on an on-call schedule for youth pool parties- Perform additional duties as warranted by management View Details Bookmark Office Assistant - Alumni Relations 2027089STP Student Affairs Student 08/14/2026 Attend various Alumni engagement events (including Homecoming) to assist in the setup, execution and/or tear down of the events. Some evening and weekend required. Some events may take place off campus.Assist the Director in preparing for monthly Alumni Association meetings.Organize and inventory Alumni giveaways/swag.Assist in creating social media content and marketing materialsAssist in upda... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Nursing 2026048FP College of Nursing Faculty Teaching:Participates in the development and evaluation of the ASN and/or BSN programDevelops, teaches, and evaluates assigned coursesEvaluates student performance on exams and course assignmentsEvaluates student performance in the clinical environment; including skills lab and simulation labAssumes responsibility for serving as a course coordinator, as appropriateCoordinates clinical rotation ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Nursing 2026047FP College of Nursing Faculty 09/11/2026 Teaching:Participates in the development and evaluation of the ASN and/or BSN programDevelops, teaches, and evaluates assigned coursesEvaluates student performance on exams and course assignmentsEvaluates student performance in the clinical environment; including skills lab and simulation labAssumes responsibility for serving as a course coordinator, as appropriateCoordinates clinical rotation ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of History 2026046FP Dept of Social Science Faculty 09/21/2026 The History Program at Fairmont State University is currently recruiting candidates for a tenure-track Assistant Professor of History specializing in Public History for a Fall 2027 appointment. The successful candidate for this position will teach courses in History as well as for the Museum Studies minor, with teaching responsibilities divided 50-50 between those fields. The successful candida... View Details Bookmark Residence Hall Monitor 2027087STP Housing & Student Conduct Student Assist students living in a residence hall. Assist in developing and maintaining an environment conducive to the residents’ health, safety, and welfare so that students can best meet their academic responsibilities. View Details Bookmark Safety Intern 2027080STP Facilities - Construction and Safety Student 06/30/2026 Conduct safety training and safety/fire inspections; assist with programs; research safety topics; update Audit Safety Programs; and perform other duties as assigned by specialist. View Details Bookmark Intramural Student Official 2027078STP Auxiliary Events and Services Student Purpose:This position, under the direction of the Intramural and Club Sports Coordinator, is responsible for officiating a variety of intramural sports. This person will enforce all Intramural and Falcon Center policies and be able to communicate to a diverse group of patrons why the policies are in place. This person will enforce all intramural sport rules and regulations. Description of Job D... View Details Bookmark NEST Assistant 2027077STP Student Affairs Student 05/14/2027 - Open and close the NEST; located in the Falcon Center- Assist students selecting items; ensure Needs Survey and Selection Forms are completed.- Responsible for stocking shelves, taking inventory and monitoring product expiration.- Participate in special events and work closely with Student Government.- Document and report any concerns with the supervisor. View Details Bookmark IT - Audio/Visual Services Assistant 2027073STP Tech Commons Student Student will assist the Information Systems and Audio/Visual Services team with campus event support, equipment setup, inventory management, and general logistics for technology and multimedia resources across Fairmont State University. This position provides hands-on experience with event technology, equipment management, and customer service while supporting university operations.Assist with ... View Details Bookmark Operations Assistant - Athletics Dept. 2027072STP Athletics Student Support the Athletics Department with the following:1. Operate concession stand, including: managing sales (handling cash), preparing food, product inventory and stocking; and cleaning concession stand and equipment, etc.2. Washing uniforms and delivering uniforms to proper locker rooms3. Operate cameras (video tape practices and games) and other technology to assist coaches in game analysis an... View Details Bookmark AIMSS Mentor FWS - AY 26/27 2027071STP Dept of Education Student 06/30/2027 AIMSS mentor will work with students, one-on-one and in groups, to support students’ goals related to academics, college experience, and life planning. Mentors engage with students in various settings on campus and in the community, assist in the assessment of students’ support needs and creation of person-centered plans, design and implement intervention strategies, and evaluate student progre... View Details Bookmark Office Assistant - Student Activities 2027067STP Student Engagement Student The Student Activities – Student Worker will work closely with the Coordinator of Student Activities and Organizations to execute the vision of the Office of Residential and Student Life (ORSL) at Fairmont State University.- Assist with the planning and execution of campus activities and events including set up and tear down, as well as being in attendance.-Help to plan and execute Leadership S... View Details Bookmark Student Assistant to the Provost Office 2027054STP Academic Affairs (Provost Office) Student The Student Assistant to the Provost Office provides administrative, logistical, and project-based support to ensure smooth and professional operations within a high-profile group of offices/functions overseen by the Provost’s office. This role is ideal for a motivated student with strong communication and organizational skills, a high level of discretion, and an interest in education, leadersh... View Details Bookmark Center of Hope Academic Enrichment Afterschool Program 2027052STP Enrollment Management Student * Must have transportation to the off-campus site *The Center of Hope Academic Enrichment Afterschool Program serves as a hub for social and educational outreach to the surrounding community. Its mission includes helping students to be academically successful.Tutoring is offered during after school hours, Monday – Thursday, from 2:30pm – 6:30 pm. Ideally tutors would be available 2-3 days per w... View Details Bookmark Marion County Humane Society - Animal Care Associate 2027038STP Enrollment Management Student * Must have transportation to the off-campus site *The Humane Society is located at 2731 Locust Ave, Fairmont, WV 26554Animal Care:Provide adequate food and water, bathing, and basic grooming to shelter animalsAssist with animal intake, evaluation, and treatmentCreate and maintain necessary animal records, report logs, and perform data entryFollow all established protocols and safety guidelines... View Details Bookmark Office Assistant – Career Development and Community Engagement 2027035STP Career Development & Community Engagement Student - Support department events (career fairs, workshops, industry days, mock interview days, community/service learning events) including: set up/break down; distribute/post flyers on campus; network with students, and attend whenever possible- Manage the career closet: keep it organized, keep clothes pressed, maintain inventory, suggest and research new purchases etc.- Manage and update the Caree... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next Contact Us For questions relating to Faculty/Staff positions, please e-mail the Human Resources Office at HR@fairmontstate.edu or call (304) 367-4111. For questions relating to Student Employment, please e-mail the Student Employment Office at studentjobs@fairmontstate.edu or call (304) 367-4836. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
